OL,3,GNEWSA'Victory' as #10m secured for
OL,4,Aunderpass at crossing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has agreed to contribute #10m
OL,7,Ftowards replacing a level crossing with
OL,8,Fa road underpass.
OL,10,FOxfordshire County Council passed a
OL,11,Fmotion on Tuesday to commit to
OL,12,Fproviding the funding for the project
OL,13,Fat Bicester's London Road. It was
OL,14,Fdescribed by the local MP as a
OL,15,F"victory" for the town.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
