OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Victory' as #10m secured for
OL,4,Aunderpass at crossing
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast West Rail's (EWR) earlier plans
OL,7,Fwould have restricted the crossing to
OL,8,Fpedestrians and cyclists. But after
OL,9,Flengthy opposition from residents, it
OL,10,Fsaid its preferred option was now a
OL,11,Fsingle-lane underpass for motor
OL,12,Fvehicles.
OL,14,FThe crossing is set to permanently
OL,15,Fclose on safety grounds when the EWR
OL,16,Fline becomes fully operational.
